@NAME@ @VERSION@
================

A small GTK 3 program for RISC OS, made from the riscos-gtk devkit's
template.

Click Select on its icon bar icon for a window. Click Menu over the
window for its menu: File (Open, Save as, Quit) and Help (the riscos-gtk
web site). Drop a Text file on the icon to load it.

It needs RISC OS 5, a 16 or 32 bpp screen mode, and SharedUnixLibrary
1.16 or later, ARMEABISupport and Iconv from PackMan.

Problems are written to its Log, <Wimp$ScrapDir>.@NAME@.Log.

